## Password sign-in → signed-in page

MEASURED  Click "Sign in" → signed-in page painted: median 234 ms (runs 1380, 355, 234, 223, 215)
          includes the sign-in request (Turnstile siteverify, password hash check), the redirect, proxy and the /app render
MEASURED  proxy.ts session check: proxy;dur=1.6; /app session + role read: 4.0 ms; database queries per signed-in page load (proxy + page): 7
          local Postgres; on Vercel hnd1 → Supabase ap-northeast-1 each query adds a network round trip

## Fast submit: the form is sent the moment it is usable (password manager)

MEASURED  Open /login, autofill and submit at once → signed-in page: median 2951 ms (runs 2951, 2587, 3019, 2512, 2952)
          here the person waits for Turnstile's token; target ≤1.0 s usable applies to the form, which is usable in tens of ms

