## Sign-in from a server action (auth.api, not the HTTP handler)

FINDING   A server action calling auth.api.signInEmail signs in WITHOUT a Turnstile token: the captcha plugin only guards HTTP requests to /api/auth
          So every Lane sign-in, sign-up, code and reset form must call /api/auth from the browser (Better Auth's client), never auth.api from an action.
CONFIRMED When a server action signs in, nextCookies() sets the session cookie
          better-auth.session_token
